	(text "LAN (v1.0, stage A6): W5500 hardware TCP/IP on SPI3 (MCU PC10 SCLK, PC11 MISO, PC12 MOSI, PA15 CS, PD5 INT, PD10 RST; 10k pull-ups R119-R121).\nRJ45 J22 HanRun HR911105A with integrated 1CT:1CT magnetics, internal Bob-Smith network (4x75R + 1000pF/2kV to CHS GND pin 8, tied to PCB GND per HanRun note), green LED 9/10 = LINK, yellow LED 12/11 = ACT (330R, W5500 LED outputs active low).\nValues follow the WIZnet W5500 reference schematic (external magnetics, 2015): TXP/TXN 49.9R to 3V3A, TX centre tap 10R + 22nF; RXP/RXN 6.8nF series, 82R to the RX centre tap, 10nF; EXRES1 12.4k 1%; 1V2O 10nF; TOCAP 4.7uF; VBG floating; RSVD 23 to GND, RSVD 38-42 open; PMODE 111 = auto-negotiation (10k to 3V3); 25 MHz crystal with 18pF and 1M.\n3V3A through FB2 600R@100MHz with 10uF + 5x100nF; VDD 10uF + 100nF. Firmware driver is a later stage: at reset RST is held low by the MCU, CS high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fd191e55-21d3-436c-942c-abaa4466eafd")
	)
